  "body": "* Brand-new home with contemporary design and a practical family layout\r\n* Four bedrooms, two bathrooms and a single internal-access garage\r\n* Approx. 150sqm floor area on a 324sqm section\r\n* Open-plan kitchen, dining and living area designed for easy everyday living\r\n* Modern kitchen with a generous island, quality appliances and excellent storage\r\n* Seamless connection to the deck and landscaped garden for relaxed outdoor living\r\n* Private master suite with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n* Three additional bedrooms supported by a well-appointed family bathroom with bathtub\r\n* 10-Year Master Build Guarantee for added peace of mind\r\n\r\nFresh, modern and thoughtfully planned, this brand-new home offers an easy balance of style, comfort and functionality in a well-established part of Orewa.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area creates a welcoming space for both everyday routines and entertaining. The contemporary kitchen is finished with a generous island, quality appliances and ample storage, while wide sliding doors extend the living outdoors to a private deck and landscaped garden.\r\n\r\nThe master bedroom is positioned to provide a sense of privacy, complete with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite. Three further bedrooms offer flexibility for children, guests or working from home, with the family bathroom adding a bathtub for everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nA single internal-access garage provides secure parking and useful storage, while the home's modern construction is backed by a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee.\r\n\r\nEveryday essentials are close at hand, with local schools, parks, shops, cafés, supermarkets, public transport and walking tracks all within easy reach. Orewa Beach is just minutes away, offering the perfect setting for a morning walk, a weekend swim or an easy escape to the coast.\r\n\r\nWhether you're stepping onto the property ladder, looking for a modern family home or seeking a low-maintenance investment, 55 Huanui Drive presents an opportunity to enjoy the best of contemporary living in a convenient Orewa location.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson & Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes. Learn more at www.vinsonamyandco.nz.",
